WEBVTT

00:00:00.800 --> 00:01:37.920
[ Watch on kissFlix.co ]

00:01:41.440 --> 00:01:42.480
Xiao Ruan.

00:01:42.800 --> 00:01:44.280
Wake up. It's time to eat.

00:01:53.280 --> 00:01:54.640
Wake up. Come and eat.

00:02:00.440 --> 00:02:02.360
Ruan Ruan, wake up.

00:02:05.880 --> 00:02:07.440
Ruan Ruan, wake up.

00:02:08.160 --> 00:02:09.160
Let's eat.

00:02:19.040 --> 00:02:20.040
Did you not sleep well?

00:02:21.200 --> 00:02:22.200
Go wash up first.

00:02:52.120 --> 00:02:53.120
Wake up.

00:02:54.160 --> 00:02:55.160
Wash up and eat.

00:03:11.160 --> 00:03:12.160
What's wrong?

00:03:24.760 --> 00:03:25.760
Don't cry.

00:03:40.240 --> 00:03:41.240
I want to...

00:03:43.160 --> 00:03:44.240
take you somewhere.

00:03:47.840 --> 00:03:50.200
(Episode 24:
Landing Right on My Heart)

00:03:56.120 --> 00:03:57.159
Actually,
what you did this morning...

00:03:57.160 --> 00:03:58.160
was quite nice.

00:03:59.280 --> 00:04:00.320
That wouldn't do.

00:04:01.200 --> 00:04:02.200
It wasn't serious enough.

00:04:02.360 --> 00:04:03.360
Nor was it formal enough.

00:04:06.800 --> 00:04:07.800
Is it up ahead?

00:04:08.680 --> 00:04:09.680
Just up ahead.

00:04:10.480 --> 00:04:12.880
(Ruan Zheng Feng's grave)

00:04:21.480 --> 00:04:23.200
(Ruan Zheng Feng's grave)

00:04:30.480 --> 00:04:32.280
Dad, we're here to see you.

00:04:33.200 --> 00:04:34.200
This is my boyfriend,

00:04:34.600 --> 00:04:35.600
Fu Ming Yu.

00:04:36.800 --> 00:04:37.800
Hello, Mr. Ruan.

00:04:38.880 --> 00:04:39.880
To be precise,

00:04:40.280 --> 00:04:41.640
I'm Si Xian's fiancé.

00:04:43.720 --> 00:04:45.280
The unofficial one.

00:04:55.920 --> 00:04:56.920
Looking at him,

00:04:57.560 --> 00:04:58.560
he doesn't really look like...

00:04:58.560 --> 00:04:59.560
a Chinese teacher.

00:05:01.560 --> 00:05:02.680
He served in the army before.

00:05:03.240 --> 00:05:04.240
He served in the army?

00:05:05.640 --> 00:05:06.960
Then what kind of person was he?

00:05:09.640 --> 00:05:10.640
My dad...

00:05:10.680 --> 00:05:11.680
was very warm-hearted.

00:05:12.440 --> 00:05:13.440
All the neighbors...

00:05:13.520 --> 00:05:14.760
knew he had a good temper.

00:05:15.240 --> 00:05:16.400
Ever since I can remember,

00:05:16.880 --> 00:05:18.840
I've never seen him
lose his temper with my mom.

00:05:19.920 --> 00:05:21.480
And he was a great cook.

00:05:23.480 --> 00:05:24.480
My mom...

00:05:24.880 --> 00:05:26.560
loved his sweet and sour ribs.

00:05:28.360 --> 00:05:29.600
Even though his salary wasn't high,

00:05:30.360 --> 00:05:31.360
our family...

00:05:31.560 --> 00:05:32.880
had them every Friday.

00:05:34.400 --> 00:05:35.400
I can still remember...

00:05:35.720 --> 00:05:36.760
the smell.

00:05:37.920 --> 00:05:38.920
Looking at it that way,

00:05:39.240 --> 00:05:41.200
your dad really doted
on you and your mom.

00:05:42.680 --> 00:05:43.680
They're right.

00:05:44.360 --> 00:05:45.360
Girls...

00:05:45.400 --> 00:05:46.760
are just closer to their dads.

00:05:50.480 --> 00:05:51.480
But do you know?

00:05:51.720 --> 00:05:52.720
In a family,

00:05:53.480 --> 00:05:55.480
one parent usually
plays the bad cop,

00:05:55.720 --> 00:05:56.720
and the other plays the good cop.

00:05:57.320 --> 00:05:58.320
Wasn't your mom...

00:05:58.920 --> 00:05:59.920
the bad cop?

00:06:03.880 --> 00:06:06.040
I used to mistakenly believe...

00:06:07.080 --> 00:06:08.680
that my mom was materialistic...

00:06:09.240 --> 00:06:10.240
and had an affair.

00:06:10.440 --> 00:06:11.560
That's why she left my dad.

00:06:13.360 --> 00:06:15.040
But I only realized recently...

00:06:16.000 --> 00:06:17.080
that the man...

00:06:17.360 --> 00:06:18.400
was actually my mom's manager.

00:06:19.120 --> 00:06:21.120
My dad was very helpful back then.

00:06:21.920 --> 00:06:23.880
He often gave
the neighbors' kids extra lessons.

00:06:24.880 --> 00:06:26.280
Some naughty kids...

00:06:26.680 --> 00:06:28.080
broke my mom's plaster sculptures.

00:06:29.000 --> 00:06:30.240
My dad was too embarrassed...

00:06:30.320 --> 00:06:31.320
to say anything,

00:06:32.000 --> 00:06:33.200
because he always felt that...

00:06:34.040 --> 00:06:35.400
during his time
as a volunteer teacher,

00:06:35.760 --> 00:06:36.960
he relied on the neighbors' help.

00:06:38.920 --> 00:06:39.920
Until one day,

00:06:41.200 --> 00:06:42.200
a child...

00:06:42.680 --> 00:06:43.840
tore up my mom's painting.

00:06:45.120 --> 00:06:46.760
My dad just told my mom
not to be angry.

00:06:47.920 --> 00:06:49.080
The child didn't know any better,

00:06:49.440 --> 00:06:50.440
and she could just paint it again.

00:06:51.440 --> 00:06:52.440
Actually, those words...

00:06:52.800 --> 00:06:54.640
were what triggered
the breakdown of their relationship.

00:06:56.440 --> 00:06:57.440
Maybe at that moment,

00:06:57.441 --> 00:06:58.560
my mom realized that...

00:06:59.640 --> 00:07:01.600
my dad only had respect for her.

00:07:02.720 --> 00:07:03.720
For the rest of his life,

00:07:04.520 --> 00:07:05.880
he could never understand her soul.

00:07:08.240 --> 00:07:09.240
Yes.

00:07:10.280 --> 00:07:11.400
As children,

00:07:12.000 --> 00:07:13.759
it's very easy for us
to see things...

00:07:13.760 --> 00:07:14.760
from your dad's perspective.

00:07:15.560 --> 00:07:16.560
But what about your mom?

00:07:18.640 --> 00:07:19.760
Who truly understood her?

00:07:20.160 --> 00:07:21.880
That's what I only realized...

00:07:22.000 --> 00:07:23.040
when I looked back on the past.

00:07:24.080 --> 00:07:25.680
But back then,
how could I have understood that?

00:07:27.200 --> 00:07:28.200
Even though my dad...

00:07:29.440 --> 00:07:30.720
told me not to talk
about her like that,

00:07:32.560 --> 00:07:34.160
I still said...

00:07:35.240 --> 00:07:36.920
so many hurtful things to her.

00:07:37.840 --> 00:07:38.840
Mom...

00:07:39.040 --> 00:07:40.400
was the woman Dad loved the most.

00:07:41.600 --> 00:07:42.600
Maybe those words...

00:07:43.160 --> 00:07:44.160
hurt him as well.

00:08:11.680 --> 00:08:12.719
Then schedule everything...

00:08:12.720 --> 00:08:13.720
for tomorrow.

00:08:14.200 --> 00:08:15.200
I'm hanging up.

00:08:17.800 --> 00:08:18.800
If you're busy,

00:08:19.360 --> 00:08:20.360
go ahead and do your work.

00:08:21.640 --> 00:08:22.640
It's not important.

00:08:23.080 --> 00:08:24.080
Let me take you somewhere.

00:08:45.120 --> 00:08:46.120
Come.

00:08:51.720 --> 00:08:52.720
Where is this?

00:08:53.720 --> 00:08:54.760
The back door of an art gallery.

00:08:56.560 --> 00:08:57.560
What are we doing here?

00:08:58.840 --> 00:09:00.359
We want to turn W.T Airport...

00:09:00.360 --> 00:09:01.760
into an artistic landmark.

00:09:02.040 --> 00:09:03.320
So I brought you here
to pick some art.

00:09:04.680 --> 00:09:06.480
Did you ever fantasize as a kid...

00:09:06.960 --> 00:09:09.000
about being locked inside
a department store...

00:09:09.800 --> 00:09:11.080
after it's closed?

00:09:11.360 --> 00:09:12.360
Not really.

00:09:12.640 --> 00:09:13.640
I did.

00:09:14.880 --> 00:09:15.880
And then,

00:09:16.400 --> 00:09:18.480
I would become
the owner of the department store.

00:09:19.040 --> 00:09:20.439
I'd eat all the snacks...

00:09:20.440 --> 00:09:21.640
my mom wouldn't let me have.

00:09:25.000 --> 00:09:26.440
This one is quite interesting.

00:09:31.160 --> 00:09:32.320
It's so expensive!

00:09:33.920 --> 00:09:35.080
My goodness.

00:09:37.280 --> 00:09:38.400
Tell me,

00:09:38.640 --> 00:09:39.640
why didn't I inherit...

00:09:39.641 --> 00:09:41.440
my mom's artistic genes?

00:09:42.680 --> 00:09:44.600
If I had pursued art too,

00:09:45.240 --> 00:09:46.680
I'd probably be financially
independent by now.

00:09:47.240 --> 00:09:48.800
Not everyone who studies art...

00:09:49.080 --> 00:09:50.640
can sell their work for this much.

00:09:54.480 --> 00:09:55.880
Actually, many artists...

00:09:56.680 --> 00:09:57.680
work very hard...

00:09:58.360 --> 00:09:59.960
for most of their lives,

00:10:00.240 --> 00:10:01.240
yet their work...

00:10:01.241 --> 00:10:02.800
might not be accepted by the world.

00:10:03.920 --> 00:10:05.960
Some of them choose
to further their studies abroad,

00:10:06.920 --> 00:10:08.640
but most of them...

00:10:09.520 --> 00:10:10.520
still end up...

00:10:10.800 --> 00:10:11.800
living in basements...

00:10:12.280 --> 00:10:13.680
or washing dishes.

00:10:15.000 --> 00:10:16.000
That's true.

00:10:16.920 --> 00:10:17.920
In every industry,

00:10:18.480 --> 00:10:20.480
it's not easy
to succeed just like that.

00:10:26.000 --> 00:10:27.120
Why are these paintings...

00:10:27.440 --> 00:10:29.520
all missing a patch of color?

00:10:30.640 --> 00:10:31.640
How about...

00:10:31.840 --> 00:10:32.840
you give me one?

00:10:33.200 --> 00:10:34.520
I'll take it home
and color it for fun.

00:10:36.520 --> 00:10:38.520
If the artist heard me say that,

00:10:39.080 --> 00:10:40.440
they'd probably be furious.

00:10:41.880 --> 00:10:42.920
I don't think so.

00:10:44.960 --> 00:10:45.960
Or,

00:10:46.720 --> 00:10:47.960
you can ask the artist yourself.

00:10:48.720 --> 00:10:49.720
Who?

00:11:17.120 --> 00:11:18.800
When Ming Yu called me,

00:11:20.040 --> 00:11:21.040
I didn't know...

00:11:21.640 --> 00:11:22.960
you'd be here today too.

00:11:23.320 --> 00:11:24.320
This afternoon,

00:11:25.360 --> 00:11:27.400
I took him to see Dad.

00:11:32.920 --> 00:11:33.920
Ruan Ruan.

00:11:35.560 --> 00:11:36.560
I know...

00:11:38.440 --> 00:11:39.440
that in your heart,

00:11:40.800 --> 00:11:41.800
you must still resent me...

00:11:42.200 --> 00:11:43.520
for leaving your dad...

00:11:46.440 --> 00:11:47.440
and you back then.

00:11:48.400 --> 00:11:49.400
Actually,

00:11:51.200 --> 00:11:52.200
there were many times...

00:11:53.440 --> 00:11:54.519
I wanted to find a chance...

00:11:54.520 --> 00:11:56.040
to explain it all to you.

00:11:58.080 --> 00:11:59.160
But then I thought,

00:12:00.040 --> 00:12:01.040
since...

00:12:01.680 --> 00:12:03.200
I made that choice back then,

00:12:04.120 --> 00:12:05.120
explaining...

00:12:05.360 --> 00:12:06.480
wouldn't have helped anyway.

00:12:07.760 --> 00:12:08.760
I...

00:12:10.520 --> 00:12:11.840
I know that all these years,

00:12:13.240 --> 00:12:14.240
you've suffered...

00:12:15.640 --> 00:12:16.640
a lot on your own.

00:12:19.400 --> 00:12:20.480
You've been through so much.

00:12:21.880 --> 00:12:23.520
And I could only...

00:12:23.960 --> 00:12:24.960
watch from afar...

00:12:26.720 --> 00:12:28.160
and tell you in my heart,

00:12:29.040 --> 00:12:30.400
over and over again,

00:12:33.680 --> 00:12:34.680
"I'm sorry."

00:12:42.200 --> 00:12:43.200
I'm sorry.

00:12:47.720 --> 00:12:48.800
I don't know either.

00:12:51.120 --> 00:12:52.320
I don't know how...

00:12:53.400 --> 00:12:54.520
I've made it through
all these years.

00:12:55.920 --> 00:12:56.920
Ever since...

00:12:59.160 --> 00:13:00.520
the day you left,

00:13:02.600 --> 00:13:03.880
my longing for you...

00:13:05.200 --> 00:13:07.080
grew more and more
every day and night.

00:13:10.560 --> 00:13:12.000
The more I missed you,

00:13:14.320 --> 00:13:15.720
the more vulnerable I felt.

00:13:18.240 --> 00:13:19.240
The more I hated you,

00:13:20.200 --> 00:13:21.640
the tougher I became.

00:13:23.080 --> 00:13:24.120
I just wondered...

00:13:26.000 --> 00:13:27.000
why...

00:13:29.640 --> 00:13:30.640
I couldn't be...

00:13:31.120 --> 00:13:32.360
like other children,

00:13:33.880 --> 00:13:35.960
who could see their mothers
every single day.

00:13:42.040 --> 00:13:43.040
But...

00:13:44.880 --> 00:13:46.240
looking at it
from another perspective,

00:13:48.040 --> 00:13:49.760
it's because of those experiences...

00:13:50.720 --> 00:13:52.600
that I've become so strong.

00:13:58.840 --> 00:13:59.840
Mom,

00:14:01.360 --> 00:14:02.400
don't feel guilty anymore.

00:14:03.280 --> 00:14:04.320
I'm all grown up now.

00:14:04.920 --> 00:14:05.920
Look.

00:14:06.800 --> 00:14:07.800
Now,

00:14:08.080 --> 00:14:09.600
I've achieved my dream,

00:14:11.080 --> 00:14:12.520
and I have someone
who loves me very much.

00:14:14.560 --> 00:14:16.280
Just go ahead...

00:14:17.280 --> 00:14:18.280
and boldly...

00:14:19.200 --> 00:14:20.200
be yourself.

00:14:22.280 --> 00:14:23.320
Thank you, my daughter.

00:14:24.760 --> 00:14:25.760
Thank you.

00:14:26.920 --> 00:14:27.920
Mom.

00:14:44.360 --> 00:14:45.360
I'll take you home,

00:14:45.360 --> 00:14:46.360
then I need to head back
to the office.

00:14:46.680 --> 00:14:47.680
I'll ask for leave for you.

00:14:48.320 --> 00:14:49.600
You can go back now.

00:14:50.440 --> 00:14:51.440
Why are you in such a hurry
to get rid of me?

00:14:53.560 --> 00:14:54.560
I'd better take you back.

00:14:54.920 --> 00:14:55.920
Otherwise, I won't feel at ease.

00:14:58.640 --> 00:14:59.640
This is far enough.

00:15:02.960 --> 00:15:03.960
Are you doing okay?

00:15:04.080 --> 00:15:05.680
Is this how you won over...

00:15:06.120 --> 00:15:08.320
all your business partners,
one by one?

00:15:09.560 --> 00:15:10.560
I don't usually put in...

00:15:10.680 --> 00:15:11.760
this much effort for them.

00:15:12.920 --> 00:15:14.640
Why do I feel like
you've had a core upgrade...

00:15:14.800 --> 00:15:15.800
since you came back?

00:15:16.000 --> 00:15:17.000
In the past,

00:15:17.160 --> 00:15:19.080
I was only after
your handsome looks.

00:15:19.240 --> 00:15:20.880
How did I start catching feelings?

00:15:22.200 --> 00:15:23.200
This doesn't look good.

00:15:24.360 --> 00:15:25.640
Don't you feel like
you've hit the jackpot?

00:15:25.960 --> 00:15:26.960
Not really.

00:15:27.680 --> 00:15:29.120
Before, you were
just a consumer good.

00:15:29.800 --> 00:15:30.959
I accepted the wear and tear...

00:15:30.960 --> 00:15:31.960
and depreciation of your looks.

00:15:32.480 --> 00:15:34.079
But now you're emotional support.

00:15:34.080 --> 00:15:35.080
You're worth a much higher premium.

00:15:35.360 --> 00:15:36.360
If one day...

00:15:36.361 --> 00:15:37.800
you stopped being available to me,

00:15:38.360 --> 00:15:39.360
I wouldn't be able to handle it.

00:15:40.200 --> 00:15:41.200
Stop right there.

00:15:41.201 --> 00:15:43.440
Ms. Ruan,
stop objectifying your boyfriend.

00:15:46.200 --> 00:15:49.040
I feel like my sense of security
is slipping away.

00:15:49.600 --> 00:15:50.800
Could it be because...

00:15:51.240 --> 00:15:52.720
the security
at this old house is poor?

00:15:52.920 --> 00:15:53.960
Do you want to move back
to Mingchen?

00:15:55.200 --> 00:15:56.920
I don't want to.
I haven't lived here long enough.

00:15:58.400 --> 00:15:59.400
Besides,

00:15:59.640 --> 00:16:01.400
this is a house
I bought with my own money.

00:16:02.200 --> 00:16:03.480
It's my family's old home.

00:16:03.720 --> 00:16:05.200
It gives me the most security, okay?

00:16:06.600 --> 00:16:07.760
I'm going. You should head back.

00:16:46.160 --> 00:16:47.160
Fu Ming Yu!

00:16:52.400 --> 00:16:54.160
Why is it you again?

00:16:58.600 --> 00:16:59.600
Does it still hurt?

00:17:02.720 --> 00:17:03.720
Here.

00:17:09.440 --> 00:17:10.440
Does it still hurt?

00:17:11.520 --> 00:17:12.520
What do you think?

00:17:12.920 --> 00:17:15.119
Who told you to trespass...

00:17:15.120 --> 00:17:16.120
with ulterior motives?

00:17:16.560 --> 00:17:17.880
I was going easy on you.

00:17:18.080 --> 00:17:19.639
You should be glad
that I didn't have...

00:17:19.640 --> 00:17:20.840
anything handy at the time.

00:17:21.120 --> 00:17:22.400
Otherwise, your handsome face...

00:17:22.920 --> 00:17:23.920
would've been ruined.

00:17:24.160 --> 00:17:25.280
I have ulterior motives?

00:17:25.880 --> 00:17:27.440
Didn't you give me
the keys to your house?

00:17:28.120 --> 00:17:29.680
Besides, it's so windy tonight.

00:17:30.080 --> 00:17:31.440
I saw that you didn't
even close the window.

00:17:32.040 --> 00:17:33.040
You weren't even covered up.

00:17:33.320 --> 00:17:34.320
What if you catch a cold?

00:17:36.040 --> 00:17:37.280
Why are you back all of a sudden?

00:17:38.480 --> 00:17:39.600
Didn't you go back to the office?

00:17:40.560 --> 00:17:41.560
I did.

00:17:41.680 --> 00:17:43.160
Bai Yang booked
a flight for tomorrow.

00:17:43.840 --> 00:17:44.840
I'm going away for work.

00:17:44.841 --> 00:17:46.120
You're leaving tomorrow?

00:17:50.600 --> 00:17:51.680
Do you mean...

00:17:52.320 --> 00:17:53.720
you want me to get lost now?

00:17:54.040 --> 00:17:55.040
I didn't say that.

00:17:55.640 --> 00:17:57.800
I wish you could stay
for a few more days.

00:17:58.840 --> 00:17:59.840
Really?

00:18:00.680 --> 00:18:01.680
Is that what you really think?

00:18:03.680 --> 00:18:04.680
Then tell me,

00:18:05.520 --> 00:18:06.800
what are you
thinking about right now?

00:18:07.280 --> 00:18:08.280
Right now, I'm thinking...

00:18:09.160 --> 00:18:10.480
about what my ulterior motives
should be.

00:18:16.200 --> 00:18:17.280
What's this supposed to mean?

00:18:18.760 --> 00:18:20.640
A slap, then a little sweetener.

00:18:21.560 --> 00:18:22.560
Just one?

00:18:23.880 --> 00:18:25.160
How many more do you want?

00:18:31.440 --> 00:18:32.520
I'll have to do the math.

00:18:43.600 --> 00:18:47.800
(Ma'ao)

00:19:12.720 --> 00:19:13.720
I've arrived in Ma'ao.

00:19:14.320 --> 00:19:15.320
What are you doing?

00:19:16.000 --> 00:19:18.640
(Please emphasize these five strict
requirements during training.)

00:19:35.680 --> 00:19:36.680
(Ruan Si Xian)

00:19:36.681 --> 00:19:37.800
I just finished simulator training.

00:19:38.520 --> 00:19:39.640
Sure enough, as soon as you left,

00:19:39.800 --> 00:19:41.520
I was notified
that my grounding is over.

00:19:42.120 --> 00:19:43.160
If all goes well,

00:19:43.440 --> 00:19:44.600
I'll finish retraining
the day after tomorrow.

00:19:44.880 --> 00:19:45.880
After a physical exam,

00:19:45.920 --> 00:19:46.920
I can resume flying.

00:19:48.720 --> 00:19:49.919
(Fu Ming Yu)

00:19:49.920 --> 00:19:51.120
Congratulations in advance,
Captain Ruan.

00:19:57.360 --> 00:19:58.599
We haven't seen
each other for years.

00:19:58.600 --> 00:20:00.080
Let's drink
until we're drunk tonight!

00:20:00.200 --> 00:20:02.720
- Come on, cheers!
- Cheers!

00:20:07.000 --> 00:20:08.720
How about we find a KTV
and sing for a while?

00:20:08.800 --> 00:20:10.719
- Definitely!
- I know a KTV nearby.

00:20:10.720 --> 00:20:12.240
It's pretty good.
It's just around the corner.

00:20:12.480 --> 00:20:13.720
Let's go have
a few more drinks later.

00:20:13.960 --> 00:20:15.199
How about a drinking contest today?

00:20:15.200 --> 00:20:17.000
Sure! Let's go to the KTV later...

00:20:17.160 --> 00:20:18.160
and have some more fun.

00:20:18.880 --> 00:20:19.880
I'll pass.

00:20:20.120 --> 00:20:21.120
You guys go ahead.

00:20:37.280 --> 00:20:38.280
Hello?

00:20:38.320 --> 00:20:39.560
Hello? Are you home?

00:20:41.800 --> 00:20:42.800
I just got home.

00:20:44.720 --> 00:20:45.720
Why are you home so late tonight?

00:20:46.280 --> 00:20:47.280
Tonight...

00:20:47.640 --> 00:20:48.640
was a college reunion.

00:20:51.680 --> 00:20:52.680
How about you?

00:20:53.240 --> 00:20:54.240
Is your cold any better?

00:20:55.680 --> 00:20:56.680
I'm okay.

00:20:56.960 --> 00:20:58.080
Bai Yang's is a bit more serious.

00:20:58.280 --> 00:21:00.160
Even if it's not serious,
take medicine.

00:21:01.080 --> 00:21:02.760
You mentioned
a college reunion just now.

00:21:04.360 --> 00:21:05.720
Did that senior
who treated you to a meal...

00:21:06.120 --> 00:21:07.480
at the pilot talk go as well?

00:21:15.040 --> 00:21:16.040
- Forget it.
- He did go.

00:21:17.280 --> 00:21:18.280
Wait.

00:21:19.840 --> 00:21:20.840
How did you know...

00:21:21.360 --> 00:21:22.680
the one who treated me was Xie Yu?

00:21:23.320 --> 00:21:24.760
I suddenly have a bit of a headache.

00:21:25.720 --> 00:21:26.720
I'm going to rest now.

00:21:27.000 --> 00:21:28.000
Good night.

00:21:33.680 --> 00:21:34.680
Wait.

00:21:35.280 --> 00:21:36.640
Why did I hesitate just now?

00:21:38.000 --> 00:21:39.720
Now it looks even more suspicious.

00:21:42.080 --> 00:21:43.720
Fu Ming Yu, oh Fu Ming Yu.

00:21:44.640 --> 00:21:45.880
What kind of question was that?

00:21:48.080 --> 00:21:49.080
He...

00:21:49.680 --> 00:21:51.120
He's jealous.

00:21:52.440 --> 00:21:53.840
He must be jealous.

00:21:56.520 --> 00:21:57.880
Mr. Fu, you're still up?

00:21:58.200 --> 00:21:59.200
Not yet.

00:21:59.200 --> 00:22:00.200
By the way,

00:22:00.840 --> 00:22:02.080
the house across from Xiao Ruan's...

00:22:02.200 --> 00:22:03.200
has been rented.

00:22:04.160 --> 00:22:05.720
You don't have
to worry about her safety.

00:22:07.880 --> 00:22:08.880
I'll head back to rest now.

00:22:11.040 --> 00:22:12.040
Is your cold any better?

00:22:12.480 --> 00:22:13.480
Much better.

00:22:13.840 --> 00:22:15.080
I just got back
from getting an IV drip.

00:22:15.880 --> 00:22:17.240
How about you?
Do you need some medicine?

00:22:17.400 --> 00:22:18.640
- Don't catch it from me.
- I'm fine.

00:22:18.920 --> 00:22:19.920
I'm in great health.

00:22:20.240 --> 00:22:21.240
I understand.

00:22:21.760 --> 00:22:23.120
Xiao Ruan is your best medicine.

00:22:25.080 --> 00:22:26.080
Oh, right.

00:22:26.120 --> 00:22:27.120
You've always asked me...

00:22:27.360 --> 00:22:29.160
why I wear different colored socks
every week.

00:22:29.920 --> 00:22:30.920
Because life...

00:22:31.360 --> 00:22:32.400
should be colorful.

00:22:33.280 --> 00:22:34.280
I wish you both happiness.

00:22:35.040 --> 00:22:36.040
Good night.

00:22:55.560 --> 00:22:56.560
An An.

00:22:56.560 --> 00:22:57.560
How is it going?

00:22:57.720 --> 00:22:59.160
Do you need me
to go in and help you?

00:22:59.520 --> 00:23:01.280
Mom, just stay seated.

00:23:01.600 --> 00:23:03.000
There are two people in here
helping me.

00:23:04.200 --> 00:23:05.840
- Okay.
- What's the rush?

00:23:06.200 --> 00:23:07.320
Come sit for a while
and have some water.

00:23:13.200 --> 00:23:14.200
Thank you.

00:23:48.920 --> 00:23:49.920
How is it?

00:23:52.920 --> 00:23:53.920
It's okay.

00:23:53.960 --> 00:23:54.960
It's very pretty.

00:23:55.240 --> 00:23:56.360
I think it's pretty too.

00:23:57.440 --> 00:23:59.640
But the train is just so heavy.

00:24:00.000 --> 00:24:01.599
Walking around in this...

00:24:01.600 --> 00:24:02.960
is like doing a cardio workout.

00:24:04.040 --> 00:24:05.040
Mom.

00:24:05.680 --> 00:24:06.680
What do you think?

00:24:06.840 --> 00:24:07.840
It's beautiful.

00:24:08.880 --> 00:24:09.880
Really beautiful.

00:24:11.000 --> 00:24:12.000
Mom, you...

00:24:12.640 --> 00:24:13.680
I'm not even married yet.

00:24:13.960 --> 00:24:15.440
I'm just trying on a wedding dress.

00:24:15.480 --> 00:24:16.480
I know.

00:24:16.720 --> 00:24:18.120
I don't know what's come over me.

00:24:18.680 --> 00:24:20.240
Is this really necessary, you two?

00:24:20.880 --> 00:24:22.120
Getting all sentimental already.

00:24:22.480 --> 00:24:23.519
This is only the first one.

00:24:23.520 --> 00:24:24.800
There are several more to try.

00:24:25.120 --> 00:24:26.680
Do you want to cry...

00:24:27.040 --> 00:24:28.040
for every single dress?

00:24:28.600 --> 00:24:29.600
I just feel like...

00:24:30.160 --> 00:24:31.760
this is all like a dream.

00:24:32.240 --> 00:24:33.840
You two were just little girls.

00:24:34.480 --> 00:24:36.840
How did you get married
all of a sudden?

00:24:37.520 --> 00:24:39.599
Of course, I don't want you...

00:24:39.600 --> 00:24:40.600
to grow old alone.

00:24:40.920 --> 00:24:42.280
I just want to see you...

00:24:43.200 --> 00:24:44.280
marry the right person.

00:24:44.960 --> 00:24:48.200
Mom, Yan An
is becoming more driven now.

00:24:49.160 --> 00:24:50.200
Because I trained him.

00:24:50.520 --> 00:24:51.520
He's getting better and better.

00:24:51.680 --> 00:24:52.680
I know.

00:24:53.240 --> 00:24:54.560
Yan An is a good boy.

00:24:55.760 --> 00:24:56.760
It's just that...

00:24:57.200 --> 00:24:58.520
he's still not mature enough.

00:24:59.240 --> 00:25:00.240
You...

00:25:00.400 --> 00:25:01.960
have to be mentally prepared.

00:25:02.160 --> 00:25:03.160
From now on,

00:25:03.161 --> 00:25:04.680
you'll have to be there for him
as he matures.

00:25:37.840 --> 00:25:39.880
(Ruan Si Xian)

00:25:39.960 --> 00:25:40.960
I have a fever.

00:26:08.520 --> 00:26:10.080
(I have a fever.)

00:26:14.240 --> 00:26:15.279
(Voice call)

00:26:15.280 --> 00:26:16.280
(Ruan Si Xian)

00:26:22.640 --> 00:26:23.640
Hello?

00:26:24.080 --> 00:26:25.400
Why didn't you reply to my messages?

00:26:25.880 --> 00:26:27.480
My hands were full,
so I couldn't type.

00:26:28.600 --> 00:26:30.200
Ruan Si Xian, I have a fever.

00:26:30.640 --> 00:26:31.640
Open the door.

00:26:33.520 --> 00:26:35.840
- What?
- Did the fever make you go deaf?

00:26:36.280 --> 00:26:37.399
Open the door. I'm roaming.

00:26:37.400 --> 00:26:38.400
I'm hanging up.

00:26:40.000 --> 00:26:41.000
What's with the attitude?

00:26:47.120 --> 00:26:48.120
Roaming?

00:26:48.800 --> 00:26:49.800
Open the door?

00:26:53.480 --> 00:26:54.480
Open the door.

00:26:57.560 --> 00:26:59.360
You're not hiding a woman, are you?

00:27:00.240 --> 00:27:01.680
I'll give you five seconds.

00:27:02.560 --> 00:27:03.560
One.

00:27:03.840 --> 00:27:04.840
Two.

00:27:05.360 --> 00:27:06.360
Three.

00:27:06.520 --> 00:27:07.520
Four.

00:27:15.840 --> 00:27:16.840
Aren't you ecstatic?

00:27:19.160 --> 00:27:20.200
Aren't you overjoyed?

00:27:20.680 --> 00:27:21.680
Aren't you happy?

00:27:21.760 --> 00:27:22.760
Aren't you surprised?

00:27:26.040 --> 00:27:27.360
Are you really hiding a woman?

00:27:38.080 --> 00:27:39.160
Hello, your ice cream is ready.

00:27:39.440 --> 00:27:40.560
Okay. Thank you.

00:27:41.200 --> 00:27:42.200
Black truffle chocolate.

00:27:42.480 --> 00:27:43.560
Yes, I want that too.

00:27:44.320 --> 00:27:46.080
Here you go.
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:27:46.760 --> 00:27:47.760
See which one you like.

00:27:49.080 --> 00:27:50.799
This is my favorite...

00:27:50.800 --> 00:27:52.080
black truffle chocolate flavor.

00:27:53.720 --> 00:27:54.720
However,

00:27:55.120 --> 00:27:56.480
I'll let you have the first bite.

00:27:57.360 --> 00:27:58.360
Really?

00:28:06.520 --> 00:28:07.520
I must say,

00:28:07.520 --> 00:28:08.520
it's not too sweet.

00:28:09.760 --> 00:28:11.000
Fu Ming Yu!

00:28:11.680 --> 00:28:13.000
You're definitely over your fever.

00:28:13.680 --> 00:28:15.240
You almost ate
the whole thing in one bite!

00:28:16.000 --> 00:28:17.000
Look at you now.

00:28:17.200 --> 00:28:18.520
Do you still look like
a domineering CEO?

00:28:18.760 --> 00:28:19.760
Isn't there still half left?

00:28:20.040 --> 00:28:21.480
That half wouldn't even fill
a gap in my teeth.

00:28:22.200 --> 00:28:23.200
You're so annoying.

00:28:31.800 --> 00:28:32.800
Come on.

00:28:33.640 --> 00:28:34.640
It's all yours.

00:28:39.400 --> 00:28:40.640
- Okay.
- Let's go to that shop.

00:28:41.040 --> 00:28:42.040
Let's buy more.

00:28:42.080 --> 00:28:43.080
Okay.

00:28:43.480 --> 00:28:44.480
Here.

00:29:44.200 --> 00:29:45.200
It's really beautiful.

00:29:46.200 --> 00:29:47.880
You've said that many times already.

00:29:48.720 --> 00:29:49.720
It's not enough.

00:29:49.920 --> 00:29:50.920
A once-in-a-lifetime moment.

00:29:51.600 --> 00:29:52.719
I want to remember...

00:29:52.720 --> 00:29:53.720
this romantic moment forever.

00:29:54.120 --> 00:29:55.720
Then why don't
we take this romance...

00:29:56.280 --> 00:29:57.280
a little further?

00:30:03.840 --> 00:30:05.280
- What do you think?
- Did you do this?

00:30:08.640 --> 00:30:09.640
It's a bit strange.

00:30:10.320 --> 00:30:11.320
Is it?

00:30:13.320 --> 00:30:14.640
But sometimes, fate...

00:30:15.800 --> 00:30:17.200
can be a strange thing.

00:30:17.880 --> 00:30:18.880
Yet it's also wonderful.

00:30:19.680 --> 00:30:20.839
The two of us seem to have...

00:30:20.840 --> 00:30:21.920
a special connection with Ma'ao.

00:30:22.920 --> 00:30:23.959
We met on a flight...

00:30:23.960 --> 00:30:25.000
to Ma'ao.

00:30:27.320 --> 00:30:28.320
But back then,

00:30:29.800 --> 00:30:30.920
I was like a clown.

00:30:31.600 --> 00:30:33.360
We've been through
so many things together.

00:30:34.640 --> 00:30:36.720
You've also given me
so many surprises.

00:30:38.280 --> 00:30:39.280
I have no way to repay you,

00:30:40.760 --> 00:30:41.920
so I've decided
to offer myself to you.

00:30:42.720 --> 00:30:44.360
I just don't know
if I'll have the honor...

00:30:45.320 --> 00:30:46.320
of spending the rest of my life...

00:30:46.920 --> 00:30:47.920
with you.

00:31:34.880 --> 00:31:36.240
Why are you just smiling
and not saying anything?

00:31:37.000 --> 00:31:38.480
I'm proposing very seriously.

00:31:38.760 --> 00:31:39.760
I know.

00:31:40.960 --> 00:31:41.960
But...

00:31:42.080 --> 00:31:43.560
can you get up first?

00:31:43.720 --> 00:31:44.720
I won't.

00:31:44.840 --> 00:31:45.840
Unless you say yes.

00:31:46.160 --> 00:31:47.960
I want to finish
my F7 assessment first.

00:31:48.680 --> 00:31:50.280
With too much on my mind,

00:31:50.720 --> 00:31:51.720
I'm afraid I'll be distracted.

00:31:53.680 --> 00:31:54.920
So, from the sound of it,

00:31:55.320 --> 00:31:56.320
I've been rejected.

00:31:58.000 --> 00:31:59.000
No.

00:31:59.280 --> 00:32:00.720
You've passed the assessment.

00:32:01.000 --> 00:32:03.680
But you still have to go home
and wait for the notice.

00:32:04.600 --> 00:32:05.680
Go home and wait for the notice?

00:32:06.480 --> 00:32:07.480
What do you mean?

00:32:07.800 --> 00:32:09.160
Didn't expect that,
did you, Fu Ming Yu?

00:32:10.560 --> 00:32:11.719
My revenge plan...

00:32:11.720 --> 00:32:13.080
is finally complete.

00:32:19.040 --> 00:32:20.560
Well played, Ruan Si Xian.

00:32:21.240 --> 00:32:22.600
Then should I also write a letter...

00:32:22.800 --> 00:32:23.800
to try and win you over?

00:32:24.000 --> 00:32:25.440
Don't be in such a rush.

00:32:25.640 --> 00:32:26.640
Look at me.

00:32:26.720 --> 00:32:28.000
I'll become a captain
sooner or later.

00:32:28.680 --> 00:32:29.680
And you...

00:32:29.840 --> 00:32:30.840
will also, sooner or later,

00:32:30.840 --> 00:32:31.840
become my husband.

00:32:32.360 --> 00:32:33.360
But...

00:32:33.920 --> 00:32:34.920
you still have to work harder.

00:32:36.840 --> 00:32:38.560
It really hurts to be rejected.

00:32:40.720 --> 00:32:41.920
You have to learn to accept it.

00:32:42.520 --> 00:32:44.440
Uncertainty is the norm in life.

00:32:47.760 --> 00:32:48.880
That's Captain Ruan for you.

00:32:53.400 --> 00:32:54.400
How are you? Are you tired?

00:32:54.640 --> 00:32:55.719
I haven't had many flights lately.

00:32:55.720 --> 00:32:56.720
It's okay. I'm not too tired.

00:32:57.760 --> 00:32:58.760
How was your flight today?

00:32:59.200 --> 00:33:00.200
It was okay, I think.

00:33:00.200 --> 00:33:01.200
Everything went well.

00:33:01.840 --> 00:33:03.000
The weather's been nice lately too.

00:33:23.240 --> 00:33:24.519
Everyone, the check-in area...

00:33:24.520 --> 00:33:25.560
is right ahead of us.

00:33:25.880 --> 00:33:27.200
It's about a minute's walk.

00:33:27.240 --> 00:33:28.960
In about 10 minutes,

00:33:29.200 --> 00:33:31.160
we can watch a movie
under that canopy over there.

00:33:31.200 --> 00:33:34.040
Happy birthday to you

00:33:43.080 --> 00:33:45.520
(The Echoes World Tour: Jiangcheng)

00:33:51.920 --> 00:33:52.920
Check your hair.

00:33:54.160 --> 00:33:55.600
If there's any loose hair,
tuck it in later.

00:33:56.200 --> 00:33:57.200
So, no one here...

00:33:57.201 --> 00:33:58.480
is feeling unwell, right?

00:33:58.920 --> 00:33:59.920
No.

00:35:40.520 --> 00:35:41.520
It's probably a long shot.

00:35:41.680 --> 00:35:42.680
Indeed.

00:35:42.720 --> 00:35:43.720
We have to prepare well.

00:35:44.800 --> 00:35:45.800
Good luck.

00:35:59.400 --> 00:36:00.400
Ruan Si Xian.

00:36:00.800 --> 00:36:01.800
You're so amazing.

00:36:14.600 --> 00:36:15.600
Hello?

00:36:16.320 --> 00:36:17.320
Is anyone out there?

00:36:17.321 --> 00:36:18.400
The restroom door won't open.

00:36:19.040 --> 00:36:20.280
Hello? Is anyone there?

00:36:20.720 --> 00:36:21.720
Captain Ruan.

00:36:21.960 --> 00:36:23.160
Captain Ruan, is that you?

00:36:23.960 --> 00:36:25.520
Fu Ming Yu?

00:36:27.240 --> 00:36:28.640
Listen up in there.

00:36:29.040 --> 00:36:30.200
You're surrounded.

00:36:30.640 --> 00:36:31.999
What are you doing?

00:36:32.000 --> 00:36:33.200
Let me out first.

00:36:33.280 --> 00:36:35.160
Stop putting up a futile resistance.

00:36:35.560 --> 00:36:36.719
You've already completed...

00:36:36.720 --> 00:36:37.880
your F6-to-F7 assessment.

00:36:38.280 --> 00:36:39.559
Please fulfill...

00:36:39.560 --> 00:36:40.560
your promise to me immediately.

00:36:41.040 --> 00:36:43.040
The results aren't out yet.

00:36:43.080 --> 00:36:44.199
The results don't matter anymore.

00:36:44.200 --> 00:36:45.240
You'll definitely pass.

00:36:45.680 --> 00:36:47.040
Can you let me out first?

00:36:47.640 --> 00:36:48.680
Then promise me first...

00:36:49.040 --> 00:36:50.040
that you'll marry me.

00:36:50.520 --> 00:36:52.479
Are you sure
you want our proposal...

00:36:52.480 --> 00:36:53.840
to have such a unique scent?

00:36:54.000 --> 00:36:55.880
I've never cared about that.

00:36:56.480 --> 00:36:57.520
What I care about is...

00:36:58.480 --> 00:37:00.400
whether you're willing
to accept my proposal.

00:37:09.640 --> 00:37:10.640
Captain Ruan.

00:37:14.560 --> 00:37:15.560
Ruan Ruan.

00:37:18.880 --> 00:37:19.880
Then I'm coming in.

00:37:27.240 --> 00:37:28.240
What?

00:37:28.480 --> 00:37:29.480
Did your own smell get to you?

00:37:30.720 --> 00:37:32.680
Get out! This is the ladies' room.

00:37:32.840 --> 00:37:33.840
What are you doing?

00:37:36.240 --> 00:37:37.240
Then will you...

00:37:38.920 --> 00:37:39.920
accept my proposal?

00:37:47.040 --> 00:37:48.280
Are you sure you want to do it here?

00:37:48.640 --> 00:37:49.640
Of course.

00:37:50.800 --> 00:37:51.800
I'm very sure.

00:37:53.360 --> 00:37:54.360
Fine.

00:37:55.200 --> 00:37:56.200
Then I'll say yes.

00:38:12.640 --> 00:38:13.640
I'll put it on now.

00:38:33.640 --> 00:38:34.640
So beautiful.

00:38:36.280 --> 00:38:37.840
I wonder
if it's sturdy enough to hit with.

00:38:40.720 --> 00:38:41.720
What do you mean?

00:38:41.880 --> 00:38:43.800
I just want to see
if it's sturdy enough to hit with.

00:38:44.680 --> 00:38:45.680
Ruan Si Xian!

00:39:27.200 --> 00:39:28.200
Honey.

00:39:28.360 --> 00:39:30.160
Why do we have to take this flight?

00:39:31.080 --> 00:39:32.440
This is the most efficient route...

00:39:32.520 --> 00:39:33.840
I could find.

00:39:33.920 --> 00:39:35.320
But this is the only flight left.

00:39:36.000 --> 00:39:37.000
Just bear with it.

00:39:37.360 --> 00:39:39.239
No, Fu Ming Yu and the others
want to take...

00:39:39.240 --> 00:39:40.240
wedding photos
under the meteor shower.

00:39:40.560 --> 00:39:41.880
Why are we going so early?

00:39:42.680 --> 00:39:44.280
The next flight
would be more comfortable.

00:39:45.280 --> 00:39:46.520
I'm their photographer.

